dium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/9561","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/9561"}},{"id":"9567","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"6438","description":"Shows the must-make boof as well as where the pothole is. This is a sketchy drop.\r\n\r\n","caption":"Holy Shit RR side","poi_name":"Holy Shit","subject":"","author":"Scott McCorvey","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/9567","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/9567"}},{"id":"9548","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"6818","description":"2nd part (note pothole on river right)","caption":"Holy Shit (2nd part)","poi_name":"Holy Shit","subject":"The Divine Turd","author":"Jerry Jascomb","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/9548","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/9548"}},{"id":"9549","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"6818","description":"2-foot diameter log at chest height in the crux of Holy Shit...Brrrrr!!  ","caption":"Logs in Holy Shit","poi_name":"Holy Shit","subject":"Holy Shit + Timber","author":"Jerry Jascomb","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/9549","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/9549"}},{"id":"9545","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"6818","description":"Seems to be about a 1/2 mile of warmup stuff like this before \"Holy Shit\" hits the fan.","caption":"Big Creek Warmup - First Rapid","poi_name":"No Name","subject":"Big Creek","author":"Jerry Jascomb","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/9545","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/9545"}},{"id":"892967","ext":"jpg","post_id":"896722","description":null,"caption":"Big Creek @Highway 28 to Overflow Creek","poi_name":null,"subject":null,"author":null,"poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/892967","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/892967"}},{"id":"9546","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"6818","description":"Nice triple-tiered drop ending in short pool just before \"Holy Shit\" hits the fan.","caption":"Big Creek - 1st Significant Rapid","poi_name":"Unknown","subject":"Big Creek - First Significant Rapid","author":"Jerry Jascomb","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/9546","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/9546"}},{"id":"9550","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"6818","description":"Boof here....(after the log is cut!)","caption":"Approach on Holy Shit","poi_name":"Approach on Holy Shit","subject":"Holy Shit","author":"Jerry Jascomb","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/9550","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/9550"}}],"detail":{"id":"468","permitUrl":null,"permitInfo":null,"description":"Big Creek runs 2 miles from Hwy 28 to the Three Forks confluence. There are still 2 more miles of paddling out on Overflow Creek to the take-out.\n\nThe final half mile to the confluence drops 214 feet in the half mile for a nearly 430 fpm average.\n\n_\"The First time Russ Kullmar and I ran this. It had already been run once before by a local C1 paddler back in the late 1970's._\n\n_So we tracked him down and asked him... whats it like?_\n\n_\"Great run, but don't take your kayak. It gets in the way in all the portages!\"_\n\n_He was right... great run, and we only walked 1 1/2 drops (\"Jesus Christ\" and \"Holy Shit\" - aptly named by our first utterances when we saw them)._\n\n_Holy Shit is the one that ends in the big fall at the end._\n\n_Jesus Christ is the one above it that goes into a bowl... used to have a tree in it._\n\n_The names were all very expletive. Rock Bottom, Kullmars Courage, Bruces Sluice, Oh My God, Fuck Me.... I suppose most of these names have changed now.\" Corran Addison from RBP circa 1997._\n\nThere is another named drop called thunderdome.\n\n[Corran Addison's page on a Big Creek descent in the late 80's](\nhttp://www.2imagine.net/blogger2005/bigcreek.html)","averageGradient":"200","maxGradient":"258","length":"4.2","correlations":[],"pointOfInterestIDs":["112785","118066"],"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[-83.19176790284318,34.98291842779559],[-83.19189271464319,34.98296227903279],[-83.19204078130963,34.98298347903278],[-83.19216151464275,34.982981412366144],[-83.19225951464261,34.982959012366166],[-83.19241578130902,34.98288587903295],[-83.19251571464224,34.982813079033065],[-83.1925649813088,34.982754212366444],[-83.19258911464209,34.98262801236666],[-83.19258558130878,34.982202412367315],[-83.19254811464214,34.9818258123679],[-83.19253111464218,34.98162941236819],[-83.1925467813088,34.98148401236841],[-83.19261751464205,34.981340879035315],[-83.19263451464201,34.981247079035484],[-83.19267738130861,34.98094481236927],[-83.19266738130864,34.98042261237009],[-83.19265938130866,34.980268012370345],[-83.19265691464199,34.980176079037165],[-83.19265511464198,34.98012747903721],[-83.19269278130861,34.98010747903726],[-83.19270378130858,34.980082479037264],[-83.19271938130856,34.980059279037334],[-83.19274898130851,34.98003587903736],[-83.1927643146418,34.98000121237072],[-83.19281858130842,34.97994861237083],[-83.19291058130824,34.97991827903752],[-83.1929887146415,34.97989021237089],[-83.19306991464134,34.97988681237092],[-83.19312551464128,34.97988387903757],[-83.19316918130784,34.97987161237097],[-83.19329191464101,34.97985987903763],[-83.19347971464072,34.97985267903766],[-83.19361438130716,34.97985601237099],[-83.19365651464045,34.97986861237092],[-83.19369611464037,34.979873612370966],[-83.193730914640